<span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"72b91474745d70ea\" href=\"?note=72b91474745d70ea\" title=\"20-thm-tot-complexity\">20-thm-tot-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1e47661fa15be194\" href=\"?note=1e47661fa15be194\" title=\"20-thm-cof-complexity\">20-thm-cof-complexity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\{\\langle e,j\\rangle:W_e\\subseteq W_j\\}\">\\(I=\\{\\langle e,j\\rangle:W_e\\subseteq W_j\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\{\\langle e,j\\rangle:W_e=W_j\\}\">\\(E=\\{\\langle e,j\\rangle:W_e=W_j\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^*,E^*\">\\(I^*,E^*\\)</span> 把对应关系换为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq^*,=^*\">\\(\\subseteq^*,=^*\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"68ee45ca9dee2182\" href=\"?note=68ee45ca9dee2182\" title=\"20-df-mod-finite\">20-df-mod-finite</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"72b91474745d70ea\" href=\"?note=72b91474745d70ea\" title=\"20-thm-tot-complexity\">20-thm-tot-complexity</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"1e47661fa15be194\" href=\"?note=1e47661fa15be194\" title=\"20-thm-cof-complexity\">20-thm-cof-complexity</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce-relation-complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(I,\\Pi_2^0)\\land\\operatorname{Complete}_m(E,\\Pi_2^0)\n\\land\\operatorname{Complete}_m(I^*,\\Sigma_3^0)\\land\\operatorname{Complete}_m(E^*,\\Sigma_3^0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ce-relation-complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(I,\\Pi_2^0)\\land\\operatorname{Complete}_m(E,\\Pi_2^0)\n\\land\\operatorname{Complete}_m(I^*,\\Sigma_3^0)\\land\\operatorname{Complete}_m(E^*,\\Sigma_3^0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>包含等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x,s\\exists t\\ [x\\in W_{e,s}\\Rightarrow x\\in W_{j,t}]\">\\(\\forall x,s\\exists t\\ [x\\in W_{e,s}\\Rightarrow x\\in W_{j,t}]\\)</span>，给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2\">\\(\\Pi_2\\)</span> 上界；相等加上反向包含，两个时间见证可用较大阶段合并。模有限包含等价于存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 后仅对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\ge N\">\\(x\\ge N\\)</span> 要求同一公式，给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_3\">\\(\\Sigma_3\\)</span>；模有限相等用两个方向的共同有限界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_a=\\omega\">\\(W_a=\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\mapsto\\langle a,e\\rangle\">\\(e\\mapsto\\langle a,e\\rangle\\)</span> 把 Tot 同时归约到包含和相等关系，把 Cof 同时归约到两种模有限关系。对应上游完全性和这些可计算归约给困难性；配对也使这些具体归约单射。关系集合均在数对编码的载体上解释，未把集合族的关系与数集合混为一谈。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 82–83 / PDF 118–119；困难性归约为本地补证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-mod-finite","status":"resolved","id":"68ee45ca9dee2182","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mod-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-sigma-complete","status":"resolved","id":"422e06e55bbb8b2f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-tot-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"72b91474745d70ea","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-tot-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-cof-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"1e47661fa15be194","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-cof-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mod-finite","status":"resolved","id":"68ee45ca9dee2182","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mod-finite]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-sigma-complete]]；see [[20-thm-tot-complexity]]；see [[20-thm-cof-complexity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mod-finite]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see 